                    "fact": {
                        "id": "mr-highwaymen",
                        "text": {"en": "In 1961 a folk group of five Wesleyan University students took the song, under the title \"Michael\", to number one in the United States and in Britain.", "es": "En 1961, un grupo folk de cinco estudiantes de la Universidad Wesleyan llevó la canción, con el título \"Michael\", al número uno en Estados Unidos y en Gran Bretaña."},
                        "source": {"en": "Wesleyan University, History and Traditions (trivia); Official Charts Company, \"Michael\" (1961); number1sblog (UK number ones); Associated Press obituary of Dave Fisher (2010)", "es": "Wesleyan University, History and Traditions (curiosidades); Official Charts Company, \"Michael\" (1961); number1sblog (números uno británicos); obituario de Associated Press de Dave Fisher (2010)"},
                        "url": "https://wesleyan.edu/about/history-traditions/trivia.html",
                        "distinct": ["basing-the-leader"]
                    }
